# Firmware Private Libraries

This folder is reserved for project-specific PlatformIO libraries.

## Purpose

Use `lib/` when a firmware module grows large enough to become its own reusable component. PlatformIO automatically builds libraries placed in this directory and links them into the firmware.

Possible future modules:

- `MotorPwm/` for TIM1 setup and duty updates
- `PhaseVoltage/` for ADC sampling and voltage conversion
- `SerialCommands/` for command parsing
- `GateDriver/` for enable, fault, and protection handling
- `MotorSafety/` for current, voltage, and temperature limits

## Example Structure

```text
lib/
`-- MotorPwm/
    |-- src/
    |   |-- MotorPwm.cpp
    |   `-- MotorPwm.h
    `-- library.json
```

The current project keeps all firmware logic in `src/main.cpp` while the hardware bring-up code is still small.
